{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國舉行國會中期選舉【相關報道】，各地選區陸續截止投票，包括北卡羅萊納、俄亥俄、西弗吉尼亞等州的票站已關閉。</p><p>美國總統特朗普接受霍士新聞訪問時說，「相信（共和黨的選舉）結果會比你們想像要好」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T01:25:24.742790+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T00:31:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T01:38:30.512577+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T01:18:36.976598+00:00","content_hash":"ac25ea7e819c62f449ebec77e81ee36692fde4c6ea998ecbdd1361cb3bafbb6d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}